    "content": "## CV screener with review queue\nScores each CV on skills only and puts it on a shortlist or in a review pool. It never rejects anyone.\n\n**Setup:** add credentials to each node, replace every REPLACE_ME, test with one item, then activate.\n\n**Guardrails:** Name, email, phone and photo are removed before scoring. Every candidate stays in a queue; a person decides.\n\nA failed run alerts you. No secrets are stored in this file.",
